5, the Company incurred related party expenses of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_dwsn_HaulingServicesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_ark-KWMN90ibEuWSHJKy2A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_Q0_ONXd3QE2gLSmyQz-3tg">217,000</ix:nonFraction> related to hauling charges. &#160;During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company maintained a revolving credit note with a related party finance company, further discussed in Note 7. These transactions occurred with various commonly controlled companies of Wilks Brothers, LLC, the holder of approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_dei_LegalEntityAxis_dwsn_WilksBrothersLlcMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_dwsn_DawsonGeophysicalCompanyMember_FO6HUavR3kyfZ1gA_vANwg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" id="Narr_WRkJmLBtnUeou6z16w-X1A">80</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s outstanding stock. As of December 31, 2025, the Company had approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_80plHTPPLEKkqOUdaInk0A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_lD9nkC2VS0qbtqRyl8waDw">32,000</ix:nonFraction> of outstanding related party accounts payable.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For the year ending December 31, 2024, the Company incurred related party expenses of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_dwsn_HaulingServicesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember__QHqJ9rrJEC2E__WKPZuYg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_77hf3ZYquEGR170pcJggbQ">187,000</ix:nonFraction> related to hauling charges, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_dwsn_EntertainmentChargesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_1sGFstO6cUy0XL-bgzPbmA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_9whjNIj6U0eoIxky_Em6Eg">9,000</ix:nonFraction> related to entertainment expenses and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionAxis_dwsn_MergerRelatedChargesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_tK7-_kJBXU2Pg3DkZUthQw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RelatedPartyTransactionAmountsOfTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_-XCvf2K9iUuYvpAF5fhZig">6,000</ix:nonFraction> related to the merger expenses paid to various commonly controlled companies of Wilks Brothers, LLC, For the year ended December 31, 2024, the Company recorded approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_QEYf8tLB7EqgfGCF_lqMdQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerIncludingAssessedTax" scale="0" id="Narr_MCfzv-aHTEmYMGgozj06nA">30,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of related party revenue from a commonly controlled company of Wilks Brothers, LLC. As of December 31, 2024, the Company had approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_VpUe-ykUpkWU41HMR-FVXg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AccountsPayableCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_AhoWdwBE1k-2w0NXCMHrAA">26,000</ix:nonFraction> of outstanding related party accounts payable and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_VpUe-ykUpkWU41HMR-FVXg" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNetCurrent" scale="0" id="Narr_MyWHd1z--UqUKn2RCWo3Tg">no</ix:nonFraction> outstanding related party accounts receivable. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Deferred Costs and unbilled receivables</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" name="dwsn:ContractWithCustomerContractAssetTableTextBlock" id="Tb_Rfc7z9jaxUOqwbTFPs6P4A" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Following is a summary of balances of and changes in contract assets, which include unbilled receivables and deferred costs (in thousands):</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:64.82%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidde