ls="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiability" scale="3" id="Tc_Toad-r7IgE6eGhqspVpMhQ_12_6">2,567</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_xE35vdtl7EutYbI8ASc6ug_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_WDiEM9LDOkaLSHfYZ_cpMg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc__upby56zFEq5Ymag8o5lZg_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_wWGLtDJDM0OgAKJ4yHHisw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_T_NOyCzwE0umD-lIhJfKRw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_0jnJza2FJEuew_OleMBYWg_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_SBENjX_WLUyQjftVXKcmKA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_99FtdqCUV0mLilCLOkMN-A_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_Z-WE-IpkEUu5miiuZE8wuQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_3esDVngHykaeZLKVDELORQ_5_5"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock" id="Tb_EEYU3oVKMk6AZaRu4WaTlw" continuedAt="Tb_EEYU3oVKMk6AZaRu4WaTlw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">9.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Stock-Based Compensation</b> </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Since the date of its effectiveness on May 5, 2016, the Company issues new grants of stock-based awards pursuant to the Dawson Geophysical Company 2016 Stock and Performance Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2016 Plan&#8221;). All of the Company&#8217;s prior plans have expired pursuant to their terms and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_5uJD-gNID0GFkl-7dpPusw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="dwsn:AwardsPreviouslyGrantedRemainOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_IZGaMyIGWUSYsejLRyYrLw">no</ix:nonFraction> awards previously granted under prior plans remain outstanding. The awards outstanding and available under the 2016 Plan, as restated in 2020, and their associated accounting treatment are discussed below.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In 2016, the Company adopted the 2016 Plan, which provides for the issuance of up to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Plan2016Member_eufDqYLXLEK5Xl5e76huWw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_3nzIlCo-3kaaZMgixvlgFg">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of authorized Company common stock, which authorized amount was increased to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="As_Of_5_1_2018_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Plan2016Member_mYcEUVPAM0OTciI2wbx8Dw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_orMwd0BtjE6XHt4YHzrkQg">1,050,000</ix:nonFraction> as a result of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="Duration_5_1_2018_To_5_1_2018_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Plan2016Member_JWfgMlFJr0ufCurRk02v6Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="dwsn:PercentageOfStockDividendApprovedByBoard" scale="-2" id="Narr_hSvbFljmBEG0Mg_JTImWyQ">5</ix:nonFraction>% stock dividend approved by the Board on May 1, 2018. At the annual shareholders&#8217; meeting on June 9, 2020, the Company&#8217;s shareholders approved a restated version of the 2016 Plan (the &#8220;Restated 2016 Plan&#8221;), which authorized an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="Duration_6_9_2020_To_6_9_2020_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Restated2016PlanMember_Ykp12v4ZWU2sw-f2TH_ROg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_Sfx0QpapD0O5vQ23mbfTFg">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. The total aggregate numbers of shares of Common Stock reserved under the Restated 2016 Plan is <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="As_Of_6_9_2020_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Restated2016PlanMember_pjY_XVBRh0eKAApqwRdUdw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_7K0WRmrSHkyR08SCEiErgg">2,050,000</ix:nonFraction> shares. As of December 31, 2025, there were approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Restated2016PlanMember_hIRb_dbIWkGC1fPrFEUpNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_P2fEVgxqIUenT2cdF6zaUQ">773,976</ix:nonFraction> shares available for future issuance. The Restated 2016 Plan provides for the issuance of stock-based compensation awards, including stock options, common stock, restricted stock, restricted stock units and other forms. Stock option grant prices awarded under the Restated 2016 Plan may not be less than the fair market value of the common stock subject to such option on the grant date, and the term of stock options shall extend no more than <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_5_2016_To_5_5_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_dwsn_Restated2016PlanMember_ox6d__RBFUmRXb-yazrdbQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_nK99t6cb0kGKKwihpoYreQ">ten years</ix:nonNumeric> after the grant date. The Restated 2016 Plan terminates June 9, 2030.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s employees and officers that hold unvested restricted stock awarded during 2016 or thereafter are not entitled to dividends when the Company pays dividends. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Impact of Stock-Based Compensation</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfCompensationCostForShareBasedPaymentArrangementsAllocationOfShareBasedCompensationCostsByPlanTableTextBlock" id="Group_RtFjSOSsSk-jMvqpy4p7sA" continuedAt="Group_RtFjSOSsSk-jMvqpy4p7sA_2" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The following table summarizes stock-based compensation expense, which is included in operating or general and administrative expense, as appropriate, in the Consolidated Statements of Operations and Comprehensive Loss for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 (in thousands):</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:continuation id="Group_RtFjSOSsSk-jMvqpy4p7sA_2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:61.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.61%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.6%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.8%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.61%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="heigh