contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_o_nndZ3ypEWlT5Gs4AKGnA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_fRZlmx2V7k23MXuNPpGw4Q">250,000</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock unit awards during the year ended December 31, 2025 with a weighted average grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_oyjF_XmJlkOf4HWYvsTr7w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_o_nndZ3ypEWlT5Gs4AKGnA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_PhifhD8iHUGWsNQsT0MZSg">2.24</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_Uiac8UKr9kqrYoCTvuGV-g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_9rDG5wB6OkaO9r-QlZ8nYw">96,700</ix:nonFraction> restricted stock unit awards during the year ended December 31, 2024 with a weighted average grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_oyjF_XmJlkOf4HWYvsTr7w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_Uiac8UKr9kqrYoCTvuGV-g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr__-YBPZF7MkildoG64XhqVw">1.94</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The fair value of restricted stock unit awards equals the market price of the Company's stock on the grant date and generally vest in <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_o_nndZ3ypEWlT5Gs4AKGnA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_3bAkD39QFkqaoAyJBRINrw">one year</ix:nonNumeric>, or in annual increments over <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_o_nndZ3ypEWlT5Gs4AKGnA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="dwsn:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardAnnualIncrementsPeriod" id="Narr_4WGkfyxyAEa37B0DABu6cw">three years</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, there were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_T6O7aTiRLUqT_8L8IA0qKw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_zS5tiI6QF0uTRXzK7NMpAg">528,000</ix:nonFraction> of unrecognized compensation costs related to nonvested restricted stock unit awards. &#160;These costs are expected to be recognized over a weighted average period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_o_nndZ3ypEWlT5Gs4AKGnA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_XKvmkZfbU0SLhw8JHq2aWg">2.82</ix:nonNumeric> years.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Common Stock Awards</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_StockCompensationPlanMember_wwkr2ZGqhkCVsRBudxzQag" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_8mNtRfR4IEOf4iPaWdLTiQ">no</ix:nonFraction> common stock awards to outside directors during the year ended December 31, 2025. The Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_LmSpWloDkEi88Fe3pQ1Kfw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_StockCompensationPlanMember_9z7f_e3YoE-jqh-8c9uQlA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_-LkmlVbr8UqvktWQe3OhsQ">76,660</ix:nonFraction> common stock awards with immediate vesting to outside directors with a weighted average grant date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_oyjF_XmJlkOf4HWYvsTr7w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_StockCompensationPlanMember_9z7f_e3YoE-jqh-8c9uQlA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_UklcDqMMlkilbXaHTH9IsQ">1.63</ix:nonFraction> during the year ended December 31, 2024.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.31;margin-bottom:6pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" name="us-gaap:PensionAndOtherPostretirementBenefitsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_NGyilqfYkUuHz1moXDsG5g" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">10.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Employee Benefit Plans </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company provides a 401(k) plan as part of its employee benefits package in order to retain quality personnel. The Company elected to match <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ZkEGpY69d0egKdzcc12Hlw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_4iKAW8tU-UuKMvJ9wb22Lw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_7dakyLxYdkiG5HwM6yhUUw">100</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% of the employee contributions up to a maximum of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_UosV-p9Xs0GOWMtsRoTpsg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercentOfMatch" scale="-2" id="Narr_ihkk_H2WaUWMIoAY9Gzfpg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_B5Zv6QvRL0KdeQQeGRwbzA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_QA8GA_tapEmYnfDdyFRr7g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanEmployerMatchingContributionPercentOfMatch" scale="-2" id="Narr_OIeUx6H9_EKhibSvkDARsg">6</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% of the participant&#8217;s applicable compensation under its 401(k) plan for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024. The Company&#8217;s matching contributions under its 401(k) plan for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 were approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanCostRecognized" scale="0" id="Narr_71KbSyhcgkK_f3xlj4resg">584,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ZkEGpY69d0egKdzcc12Hlw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DefinedContributionPlanCostRecognized" scale="0" id="Narr_Rqww3Gp9_kWCESQdVOx2Uw">568,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" name="dwsn:AdvertisingExpenseTextBlock" id="Tb_K2W-B6gdOkaJ9pCGi9ThfQ" continuedAt="Tb_K2W-B6gdOkaJ9pCGi9ThfQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">11.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Advertising Costs</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Advertising costs are charged to expense as incurred. Advertising costs for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_-oA3_vEAUkC5x-k0N92_Ag">61,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ZkEGpY69d0egKdzcc12Hlw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AdvertisingExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_hOLRVL6jjk2UU_P3czupMA">40,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;display:table;margin-bottom:27.35pt;min-height:36pt;width:100%;"><div style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:bottom;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-19</p></div></div></div>
