0;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.57%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;">&#8212;</p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:65.83%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Net deferred tax liabilities</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.8%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.69%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.57%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_5uJD-gNID0GFkl-7dpPusw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxLiabilities" scale="3" id="Tc_Q_vC_M4elECg9ZZasg50wQ_23_3">17</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.8%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.69%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.57%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:9pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">(<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_IWIdyh6jFk6i1ezq0Cn6IQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxLiabilities" scale="3" id="Tc_n39XNg2HDUih0cVUAazc8g_23_6">16</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:12pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At December 31, 2025, the Company had a gross NOL for U.S. federal income tax purposes of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_US_m_8CviFjVUuMNmw2RdCdTQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="6" id="Narr_lSWsmhFSJUGznravFsWsUQ">174</ix:nonFraction> million but expects approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_US_m_8CviFjVUuMNmw2RdCdTQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="dwsn:OperatingLossCarryforwardsExpectsToExpireUnused" scale="6" id="Narr_ETBQ9KH2hUC4R5Dwp_bwXQ">94.8</ix:nonFraction> million to expire unused with the remaining NOL beginning to expire in 2027. Losses incurred after the year ended December 31, 2017 have no expiration. The Company will carry forward the tax benefits related to federal net NOL of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_US_m_8CviFjVUuMNmw2RdCdTQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TaxCreditCarryforwardAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_NzLwHQHzM0KgYTNZRW-ZQg">16.6</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company also had state net NOLs that will affect state taxes of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_us-gaap_StateAndLocalJurisdictionMember_dDpx156WKEingv7DP762Rg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="6" id="Narr_k26qJP5LrkOvQkiAmOQRCQ">3.8</ix:nonFraction> million at December 31, 2025. State NOLs began to expire in 2015 and continue to expire each year. The Company also had a Canadian gross NOL of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis_country_CA_hlfv4a37RUSXIKoptzKwUQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="6" id="Narr_IXmt69IPb02-Nd12GdAQGQ">22.7</ix:nonFraction> million that will begin to expire in 2037.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">In evaluating the possible sources of taxable income during 2025 and 2024, the Company determined it is more likely than not that the remaining deferred tax assets will not be realizable. As a result, the Company recorded and maintained a full valuation allowance against foreign deferred tax assets and its federal and state deferred tax assets with </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;display:table;margin-bottom:27.35pt;min-height:36pt;width:100%;"><div style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:bottom;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-21</p></div></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.31;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#Toc"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_SpO83xRhMESNeMog_prtrg_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">the exception of its trademark intangible. The change in valuation allowance amounted to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ValuationAllowanceDeferredTaxAssetChangeInAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_cPIPZxe3PEW61FZq3oWWag">0.4</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ZkEGpY69d0egKdzcc12Hlw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ValuationAllowanceDeferredTaxAssetChangeInAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_T7niRQJhYk-RMReEnwvNuA">1.1</ix:nonFraction> million for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, including amounts recorded as a component of other comprehensive income or loss. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company did <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_IWIdyh6jFk6i1ezq0Cn6IQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" scale="0" id="Narr_1lqTCFumZUecPLMRU6UsTw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_5uJD-gNID0GFkl-7dpPusw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefits" scale="0" id="Narr_22fj-wRSyE2xRXNhYyNL4g">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>t have any uncertain tax positions. The Company&#8217;s policy is to recognize interest and penalties related to an uncertain tax position in income tax expense. The Company did <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ZkEGpY69d0egKdzcc12Hlw" decimals="-5" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_LciJoERe8E-NZYhAiEwUqQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_eKNqv39Pu0yuJmen4xW2YQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_G3bgvG7cTUuW5hIFjGa1Bw" decimals="-5" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:UnrecognizedTaxBenefitsIncomeTaxPenaltiesAndInterestExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_h3k1jgqpQ0ekx9DCH-AMXQ">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>t have any material income tax interest or penalties for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024. </p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_10cd5115_5ff7_4771_b7a7_94170e1cdea4"></a><a id="Tc_zmtQN1u8r0SzLCDm2YKKTg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_xKCytaIQt0-KIr_zEt71sQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_K2-Y9JOmr0icCEp_okOQLQ_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_ZXfLk1dXZUK0oeaPwl-H5w_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_FAylE5ytRkiPza7K8Z1Q6A_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_um-k90ZmiU-2fdsfIQCOYQ_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_PwUdVEUOV0u3Ufo-AXa3Lw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_w2xy5qQPekeaAj-1DDEqGg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_LSzhifEdJ